  "description": "The Vitus 16 is designed specifically around new riders that are progressing from their first pedal bike to something a little bigger.\n\nSimilar to the Vitus 14, the 16 features geometry that optimizes stability and performance with a light weight 6061 aluminium frameset.\n\nFeaturing child friendly components such as short reach adjustable brake levers, smaller diameter handlebar grips and a bespoke chainset. Which in turn all helps improve riding stability, control and confidence, and ensure cycling is a fun experience. The 16 features a child friendly single speed gearing with a light enough action to be used on or off road. To help your child learn to stop with ease, the bike comes fitted with Tektro V-Brakes giving relable braking performance, and easy operation.\n\nTo help stability and pedalling efficiency, the 16 features a dedicated chainset that has a reduced Q Factor. This brings the pedals as close to the centre of the bike as possible, inline with the hips. As it's name implies the 16 features 16\" wheels and tyres. All-purpose Vee Speedster tyres are equally at home on hard pavement or off-road trails. The Vitus 16 is also supplied with a removeable full length chain guard for added safety.\n\nLightweight Aluminium frame and fork\n\nConfidence inspiring geometry\n\nSinglespeed gearing\n\nLow Q Factor = narrow pedals\n\nCustom bars for small hands\n\nAdjustable short-reach brake levers\n\n*Please note, this product is currently unavailable to purchase in USA and Australia.",
